{
  "id": "GAL.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Kalatia 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo omökan omwoghöy lö, otini tökïmïnïng mïlin, kïmelö sis nyinte nko sekeyon kïrkegh kö chechi tïkwïn löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mito pich cho ripöy akughyongchï tïkuchi ntökïtenö kwitïta otini kimwowï paponyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyoni tïkwïl, otini kitökechicha monïng kikïchicha sekeyo oy cho pöytoy wölnö le mïröt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kitï asisoni kikyomchï ngamata, kïyonï Tororöt Werïnyi kegh nyo kiyï korka kïrïp kegh nko kirurut pö pipö Yaudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.8.15+ROM.8.16+ROM.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 8:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " atökutyak pich cho kipöytoy kirurut atömanyïl kemukacha kelïkwï werpö Tororöt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyonï nyu Tororöt Mïkulöwuto Werïnyi kïlït mïkulöwecha, riröy Mïkulöwunoni lö, “Papo, Paponyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö techinyi nyu sekeyon ngat, wölo kelïkunyi wero Tororöt. Ato kelïkunyi wero Tororöt, kïkoninyi Tororöt tïkwïn lapay cho kikïrorchï nyinte monechi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kesus Paulö otöp nyo pö pipö Kalatia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimonkïtökwanye Tororöt atanya le tagh, opöghisyechikwa nyu tororötin cho kimelö tororötino man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otï le ye konkïtukwa Tororöt anta kïmwa köny lö, otï kakunkïtwokwa Tororöt, omukekwa lö ne ngat omïlonchone wölini mi mïkulischoni nyörkölölech le mey pö ngwïnyinï tamachakwa kwighakwa sekeykökwa ngat? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomitenökwa oripe osis nko aro nko otöptino pöghetus nko könyis! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawaghan lö manan kiwir wuw ighisyonanya kyaghan ompö akwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osomokwa nyoman werköcho lö, otïpinö le wölo alatan, ompöwölo otöponan tïkwïl le akwa. Tomönye olelchanïkwa nyonikïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onkïtökwa lö ki kösotyenyan nyo kighanïn omwokwa Lökoy cho Karamach panto tagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïrkegh kyonyorunekwa tyamat nyo wow kösotyenyan mataghanïkwanye, wölo kyatachanïkwa le nyo kitö otochekwa malaykayanta Tororöt. Kyatachanïkwa le nyo kitö otochekwa Kristo* Yeso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyochikwa ngörechote kuchumï ne ye nyu? Ompöwölo osöwintönwokwa lö, tökile nyo kimuko, kitö oködötunekwa konyikwa, akonanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawaghakan so ye nyu alïkwï punyontenkwa otï omwowokwa ngala man?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi pïchoni walaka kuporu lö sïngenokwa chane lasiny, wölo melö ompö machat nyo karam. Möchöy chane kupesyonanïn nko akwa atasïngenakwa nyu chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mïchini kesïch ye nyu machatanoni karam kïtenö osis ato karam keröte amelö otini omitan nko akwa pat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monechu cho mïnkech, otïngetan ngwonïn ompö akwa nyo lata nyo pö kama monïng nyo karich kïlusyö tökïtenö kwitïta ato rumuno Kristo orinkwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wechï kötö omökan omitö nko akwa ye nyo kötö osïkan kinonut nyo sis ompö akwa. Ompöwölo otïngetan kisusöt nyo wow ompö akwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Körkeyïn pö Akar nko Sara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanye ya köny atepakwa chona omököy kïpöytonokwa kirurut lö: olïmekwa kïgh nyo mwoghöy kirurut nya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.8.15+ROM.8.16+ROM.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 8:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ompöwölo mwoghöy Kikirut lö, kitïng Apraam wor odeny, kisïkö anka korka nyo le sekeyon, kïsïkö nyo pö odeny korka nyo le taran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikïyï weri nyo pö sekeyon le wölo kïyïytoy monïng löwïr, wölo keyï nyay pö taran kïrïp kegh nko kiyomisöto Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwoghöy ngalechoni ompö körkeyïn. Karkegh koruchoni kwodeny nko mumen odeny. Karkegh kiyomisöte nyo tagh nko nyanya kikigha kutïng pö Sinay, nyo töpo ato mi Akar akeyïchini monechi sekeynön. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo karkegh Akar nko kutïng pö Sinay nyo mi koro Arapia akekongityot nyoni nko Yerusalem nyo pö ye nyo le sekeyon nko monechi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo tyakate kanasyanta Yerusalem nyo pö parak akï yoncha nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
